(Messages \227 Marco Reyes) Tj
T*
(Mon\054 Jun 15\054 2026 at 8\07241 AM) Tj
T*
(8\07241 AM Daniel\072 Celeris just flagged my account\056 Did you use my phone yesterday\077) Tj
T*
(8\07243 AM Marco\072 Yeah\054 I used it for a little while\056 I didn\047t know it would cause a problem\056) Tj
T*
(8\07244 AM Daniel\072 What did you use\077) Tj
T*
(8\07246 AM Marco\072 I was looking at the delivery app\056 I thought it was already open\056) Tj
T*
(8\07247 AM Daniel\072 You can\047t use my driver account\056 That\047s my account\056) Tj
T*
(8\07249 AM Marco\072 I know\056 I wasn\047t trying to take your account or anything\056) Tj
T*
(8\07250 AM Daniel\072 Did you do the face check\077) Tj
T*
(8\07252 AM Marco\072 I think so\056 It came up when I opened it\056) Tj
T*
(8\07253 AM Daniel\072 Why didn\047t you tell me\077) Tj
T*
(8\07255 AM Marco\072 I didn\047t think it mattered\056 I thought you knew I was using the phone\056) Tj
T*
(8\07257 AM Daniel\072 I didn\047t know you were using the account\056 Don\047t do that again\056) Tj
T*
(Synthetic fictional record created for the DecisionLayer simulator\056) Tj
T*
ET
Q


